teslamate-rs for Debian
-----------------------

Data directory
  SQLite lives at /srv/teslamate-rs/teslamate-rs.sqlite (WAL files alongside).
  Removing the package does not delete that directory.

Service
  systemd unit teslamate-rs.service binds 127.0.0.1:4010 and does not start
  the Tesla Owner API logger until tokens are stored (teslamate-rs login).
  Override bind/port/database in /etc/default/teslamate-rs.

  This package is meant to sit beside Docker TeslaMate (port 4000), not
  replace it.

Build
  sbuild -d unstable
  The package builds offline with dh-cargo against Debian's librust-*-dev
  crates; no rustup toolchain and no crates.io access are needed. See
  debian/README.source for the crate-version notes.
